OL,3,GNEWSA'Greatest' military air show
OL,4,Aleaves RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal International Air Tattoo
OL,7,F(RIAT) is moving from its home at RAF
OL,8,FFairford in Gloucestershire to a
OL,9,Fmilitary base in Wiltshire, organisers
OL,10,Fhave confirmed.
OL,12,FThe military air show, which has been
OL,13,Fheld at the base for more than 40
OL,14,Fyears, will now take place at the
OL,15,FMinistry of Defence's (MoD) Boscombe
OL,16,FDown from 16 to 18 July 2027 and for
OL,17,Ffuture events.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
