OL,3,GNEWSA'Greatest' military air show
OL,4,Aleaves RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move follows the cancellation of
OL,7,Fthis year's show due to uncertainty
OL,8,Fover access to RAF Fairford because of
OL,9,Fthe ongoing conflict in the Middle
OL,10,FEast.
OL,12,FGavin Gager, chief executive of Royal
OL,13,FAir Force Charitable Trust Enterprises
OL,14,F(RAFCT), said: "It is about securing
OL,15,Fthe future of the world's greatest
OL,16,Fmilitary airshow."
